id: super-regeneration
name: Super Regeneration
type: awakening
subtype: lesser
origin: body
racial: Majin
prerequisites: N/A
tier: 1+
maxStacks: 2
bonuses: FO +1, TE +1, MA +1
description: >
  Whether due to your origins as a primordial being, or the uncanny nature of your enhanced body, you bear strange properties, even for a Majin. You bear stamina that seems never-ending and untouchable to those not used to your powers, and when your enemies would think you to be on the defensive, you bounce right back, more resilient than ever.
text: >
  Whether due to your origins as a primordial being, or the uncanny nature of your enhanced body, you bear strange properties, even for a Majin. You bear stamina that seems never-ending and untouchable to those not used to your powers, and when your enemies would think you to be on the defensive, you bounce right back, more resilient than ever.

  Racial Requirement: Majin / Transformation Type: Awakening / Awakening Type: Lesser / Awakening Origin: Body / Prerequisite(s): N/A / Maximum No of Stacks: 2 / Tier of Power Requirement. 1+
  AG – · FO +1 · TE +1 · SC – · IN – · MA +1 · PE –

  Untiring (1): You cannot be defeated by ordinary means; your existence is eternal.
  (1)-[Passive]: Any Traits, Maneuvers or effects used by other Characters cannot reduce or spend your Ki Points.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Surgency by Z(T).
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use a Healing Surge, regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of your Surgency.
  (4)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain Z(bT) Life and Ki Points.

  Unending (2): You are impossible to destroy, and similarly impossible to exhaust.
  (1)-[Passive]: You may use an effect with the [Triggered/Defeated] Keyword an additional time per Combat Encounter, but you can still only use the same effect once per Combat Encounter.
  (2)-[Passive]: While you are in the Healthy Health Threshold, double the bonuses from the second effect of Rubbery Body.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you receive Damage from an Attacking Maneuver, you may reduce the Damage by your Surgency.
